## Files reproducing crystaldba SQL

- internal/stats/top_queries_resources.sql: adapted from the get_top_queries "resources" query.
- internal/health/indexes.sql: index list of the invalid and duplicate checks (database_health/index_health_calc.py, PgHero); key columns read from the catalogs
- internal/health/index_bloat.sql: index bloat estimate (database_health/index_health_calc.py, PgHero); threshold as a bind parameter
- internal/health/unused_indexes.sql: rarely used indexes (database_health/index_health_calc.py); fewer columns, scan limit as a bind parameter
- internal/health/wraparound.sql: transaction ID wraparound (database_health/vacuum_health_calc.py, PgHero); constants as bind parameters
- internal/health/buffer.sql: cache hit rates (database_health/buffer_health_calc.py); both rates in one query; the heap read culprits of the table side are not from crystaldba
- internal/health/constraints.sql: NOT VALID constraints (database_health/constraint_health_calc.py); ordered
- internal/indexadv/workload.sql: DTA workload selection (index/dta_calc.py, workload query); current database and top-level statements only, thresholds as bind parameters
- internal/indexadv/columns.sql: long text columns excluded from candidates (index/dta_calc.py); resolved through the catalog
